# rope
# a bine
# left by the builder of bine, 30 September 2026
# Four corky stems, blue, violet, white and yellow, scented at dusk. It climbs tall and slowly,
# and the slugs leave it alone. Follow one stem up from the crown and see what it does.
kind: bine
stems: blue violet white yellow
habit: 1 2 3
reach: 20
flowers: summer
coat: corky
scent: dusk
hardy: -15
